### Create new raw record using object
POST https://localhost:7144/api/HarmonizedRecords
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payloadObject": {
    "projId": "PRJ-2025-001",
    "title": "Next Gen Platform Revamp",
    "status": "In Progress"
  },
  "source": "ProjectSystemX"
}

### Create new raw record using string
POST https://localhost:7144/api/HarmonizedRecords
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payload": "{\"projId\":\"PRJ-2025-002\",\"title\":\"AI Data Lake\",\"status\":\"Planning\"}",
  "source": "ProjectSystemX"
}

### Harmonize existing record (recordId = 1)
POST https://localhost:7144/api/HarmonizedRecords/harmonize/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contextPrompt": "Generate concise project report with progress %, risk summary, and next milestone.",
  "desiredSchema": {
    "report": {
      "projectId": "",
      "title": "",
      "progressPercent": 0,
      "risks": [],
      "nextMilestone": { "name": "", "targetDate": "" }
    }
  }
}

### Get record by id
GET https://localhost:7144/api/HarmonizedRecords/1

### List harmonized records
GET https://localhost:7144/api/HarmonizedRecords/harmonized?skip=0&take=20

### List all records
GET https://localhost:7144/api/HarmonizedRecords?skip=0&take=20
